+
+```sh
+mvn -B -ntp org.apache.maven.plugins:maven-help-plugin:3.5.1:effective-pom -Doutput=/home/luis/ESR/ESR---TP2/experiments/construction/001-base-validada/effective-pom.xml
+mvn -B -ntp clean verify
